// that telegraph their attacks. Readability rules (rc.md 14.6): every attack that
// is not a projectile is first painted on the floor in the attacker's colour,
// the mark flashes faster as the hit gets close, no damage lands during the
// warning, and each attack has its own wind-up pose.
